  "selection": {
    "sectionId": "S10",
    "title": {
      "zh": "当前时序",
      "en": "Current Timing"
    },
    "titleTrace": {
      "owner": "BAZI_SECTION_PURPOSE",
      "sectionId": "S10",
      "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
      "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3"
    },
    "zh-Hans": {
      "excerpts": [
        [
          {
            "text": "合说明两者之间产生连接与牵制，不等于已经完成五行转化；现有资料也没有给出化合结论。",
            "start": 182,
            "end": 223,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "更合适的说法是：承载、整理与稳定的需求进入前台，同时又与原有的现实展开路径相互缠连。",
            "start": 249,
            "end": 291,
            "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
            "roles": [
              "COUNTERWEIGHT",
              "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "它与原局申构成六合兼破，与原局寅构成害，并参与寅巳申刑。",
            "start": 401,
            "end": 429,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "text": "合、破、害、刑同时出现，表示连接、调整、隐性牵动与结构摩擦并存。",
            "start": 429,
            "end": 461,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "text": "丙寅流年进一步提高火与寅的显著度。",
            "start": 542,
            "end": 559,
            "role": "TIMING",
            "roles": [
              "TIMING",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "text": "这里所说的是结构压力的集中，而不是对迁移、人际冲突、健康或其他事件的预测。",
            "start": 662,
            "end": 699,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "text": "寅申冲也不会取消原有三合，原有三合更不会抹去当前被强化的冲；两种机制仍须并读。",
            "start": 699,
            "end": 738,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "text": "但这需要土的承接真正进入执行层面，也需要金所代表的边界与持续性没有被过度消耗。",
            "start": 810,
            "end": 849,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 4
          },
          {
            "text": "若规则清楚、职责有限、复核机制存在，多重引动可以表现为密集而有效的调整，使旧安排得到更新，新要求被纳入可管理的秩序。",
            "start": 849,
            "end": 907,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 4
          },
          {
            "text": "此时最需要观察的，不是机会数量，而是每一项安排是否有明确负责人、可用资源、完成标准与退出条件。",
            "start": 1028,
            "end": 1075,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 5
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "此时序所呈现的重点，并不是单一力量的到来，而是支持、调候与多重地支关系同时被引动，结构的活跃度和协调要求都会上升。",
            "start": 83,
            "end": 140,
            "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
            "roles": [
              "COUNTERWEIGHT"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "因此，己土不能被当作毫无条件、完全独立的支持来理解。",
            "start": 223,
            "end": 249,
            "role": "BOUNDARY",
            "roles": [
              "BOUNDARY",
              "MECHANISM",
              "COUNTERWEIGHT"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "现实层面可能更强调如何把已经启动的事项纳入规则、期限和责任结构，但是否真正减轻负担，仍取决于支持能否落实，而不只是名义上存在。",
            "start": 291,
            "end": 354,
            "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
            "roles": [
              "COUNTERWEIGHT",
              "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "年度寅重复原局寅，又冲原局申，并与大运巳相害，同时继续强化寅巳申刑的关系网络。",
            "start": 559,
            "end": 598,
            "role": "TIMING",
            "roles": [
              "TIMING",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "text": "在较顺畅的表现中，己土的承载倾向可以帮助整理流程，巳、丙之火则可能提供温度、可见度与行动动力，使原本活跃的表达与兑现路径更容易形成明确节奏。",
            "start": 740,
            "end": 810,
            "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
            "roles": [
              "COUNTERWEIGHT",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 4
          },
          {
            "text": "压力下的失真则可能来自同时把“支持出现”和“承载已经完成”视为同一件事。",
            "start": 909,
            "end": 945,
            "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
            "roles": [
              "COUNTERWEIGHT"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 5
          },
          {
            "text": "共享支持若只是口头存在，隐藏负荷仍可能集中于个人；相反，若协作能够实际分担维护和复核，这段时序的活跃度才较容易转化为可持续成果。",
            "start": 1075,
            "end": 1139,
            "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
            "roles": [
              "COUNTERWEIGHT"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 5
          },
          {
            "text": "因此，当前时序的核心是“在加速与重组中建立承载”。",
            "start": 1141,
            "end": 1166,
            "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
            "roles": [
              "COUNTERWEIGHT"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "zh-Hans",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 6
          }
        ]
      ],
      "insightCards": [
        {
          "text": "合说明两者之间产生连接与牵制，不等于已经完成五行转化；现有资料也没有给出化合结论。",
          "start": 182,
          "end": 223,
          "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
          "roles": [
            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
          ],
          "sectionId": "S10",
          "locale": "zh-Hans",
          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
          "paragraphIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "它与原局申构成六合兼破，与原局寅构成害，并参与寅巳申刑。",
          "start": 401,
          "end": 429,
          "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
          "roles": [
            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
          ],
          "sectionId": "S10",
          "locale": "zh-Hans",
          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
          "paragraphIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "此时序所呈现的重点，并不是单一力量的到来，而是支持、调候与多重地支关系同时被引动，结构的活跃度和协调要求都会上升。",
          "start": 83,
          "end": 140,
          "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
          "roles": [
            "COUNTERWEIGHT"
          ],
          "sectionId": "S10",
          "locale": "zh-Hans",
          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
          "paragraphIndex": 0
        }
      ],
      "fullManuscriptPreserved": true,
      "selectedFrom": "BAZI_PUBLICATION_LEAD_SELECTOR_V2_1",
      "selectionStatus": "PASS",
      "sourceRoles": [
        "BOUNDARY",
        "COUNTERWEIGHT",
        "TIMING",
        "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
      ]
    },
    "en": {
      "excerpts": [
        [
          {
            "text": "No Gregorian year, age, start date, or end date has been provided, so this combination can only be examined as a structural interaction with the natal chart.",
            "start": 85,
            "end": 242,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Both activity and the need for coordination are consequently heightened.",
            "start": 488,
            "end": 560,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "Ji Earth at the luck-pillar stem corresponds in principle with the chart’s need for containment, but it forms a Jia–Ji combination with the natal month stem.",
            "start": 562,
            "end": 719,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "MECHANISM",
              "TIMING"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "Combination establishes connection and mutual involvement; it does not by itself establish elemental transformation, and no transformation conclusion has been supplied.",
            "start": 720,
            "end": 888,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "A more precise reading is that organization, stabilization, and carrying capacity move to the foreground while becoming intertwined with the chart’s existing route toward practical realization.",
            "start": 994,
            "end": 1187,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "COUNTERWEIGHT"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "Si introduces Fire and therefore carries a climate-regulating implication within the cold natal setting.",
            "start": 1408,
            "end": 1512,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "text": "Yet its role is not limited to warmth.",
            "start": 1513,
            "end": 1551,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "text": "Annual Yin repeats the natal Yin, clashes with natal Shen, harms the luck-pillar Si, and reinforces the Yin–Si–Shen network.",
            "start": 2180,
            "end": 2304,
            "role": "TIMING",
            "roles": [
              "TIMING",
              "MECHANISM",
              "LIVED_EXPRESSION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "text": "Fire may warm and activate, but it cannot replace Earth-and-Metal support.",
            "start": 4487,
            "end": 4561,
            "role": "BOUNDARY",
            "roles": [
              "BOUNDARY",
              "MECHANISM",
              "COUNTERWEIGHT"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 6
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "It cannot be assigned to a definite life stage or used to assert a concrete event.",
            "start": 243,
            "end": 325,
            "role": "BOUNDARY",
            "roles": [
              "BOUNDARY"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "It forms both a combination and a break with the natal Shen, a harm with the natal Yin, and participates in the Yin–Si–Shen punishment.",
            "start": 1552,
            "end": 1687,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "text": "Combination, break, harm, and punishment thus coexist, indicating connection, readjustment, indirect strain, and structural friction at the same time.",
            "start": 1688,
            "end": 1838,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "text": "None of these should be translated directly into an inevitable conflict, loss, or relationship event.",
            "start": 1839,
            "end": 1940,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "text": "The Bing-Yin annual influence further heightens the visibility of Fire and Yin.",
            "start": 2100,
            "end": 2179,
            "role": "TIMING",
            "roles": [
              "TIMING",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "text": "This repeated and overlapping activation makes adjustment within adjustment a defining feature of the period.",
            "start": 2305,
            "end": 2414,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "text": "This indicates concentrated structural pressure, not a prediction of relocation, interpersonal rupture, illness, or any other event.",
            "start": 2549,
            "end": 2681,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "text": "The strengthened Yin–Shen clash does not cancel the natal combination, and that combination does not erase the clash; both mechanisms remain operative.",
            "start": 2682,
            "end": 2833,
            "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "roles": [
              "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
              "MECHANISM"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 3
          },
          {
            "text": "If shared support exists only verbally, hidden overload may still concentrate in one place.",
            "start": 4144,
            "end": 4235,
            "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
            "roles": [
              "COUNTERWEIGHT"
            ],
            "sectionId": "S10",
            "locale": "en",
            "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
            "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
            "paragraphIndex": 5
          }
        ]
      ],
      "insightCards": [
        {
          "text": "No Gregorian year, age, start date, or end date has been provided, so this combination can only be examined as a structural interaction with the natal chart.",
          "start": 85,
          "end": 242,
          "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
          "roles": [
            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
            "MECHANISM"
          ],
          "sectionId": "S10",
          "locale": "en",
          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
          "paragraphIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Both activity and the need for coordination are consequently heightened.",
          "start": 488,
          "end": 560,
          "role": "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION",
          "roles": [
            "DOMAIN_INTERPRETATION"
          ],
          "sectionId": "S10",
          "locale": "en",
          "authorityDigest": "3d39eb86506e43e80c1df5333539504c154e1794d1a2f8af7f8c23c69c91b97c",
          "compilerVersion": "BDM-PUBLICATION-3",
          "paragraphIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The central feature is not the arrival of one isolated influence, but the simultaneous activation of support, seasonal warming, and several branch relationships.",
          "start": 326,
          "end": 487,
          "role": "COUNTERWEIGHT",
          "roles": [
            "COUNTERWEIGHT"
          ],
          "sectionId": "S10",
          "locale": "en",
